# Bind-mounted files that are executed or parsed INSIDE the Linux containers must
# keep LF line endings: a clone with the Windows-git default core.autocrlf=true
# would otherwise convert them to CRLF at checkout.
#   - the redis HA entrypoints are run as `sh <path>` by compose.ha.yml (CRLF breaks
#     the shebang parsing and every command),
#   - sentinel.conf.tpl is rendered into the live Sentinel config (a trailing \r
#     silently changes port/quorum/auth-pass values).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.tpl text eol=lf
